## 7. Failure channel (bounded — no silent hang)

  SPONGE_FALKON_NO_FIXTURE=1 skips the host fixture; the bounded GET
  check (180s) fails loudly. The probe's own window-poll is bounded at
  600s (6000 × 100ms); on the current base-sel4 CNode limit, the probe
  polls the empty nitpicker buffer (falkon died → no window), logs
  "falkon-probe: FAIL falkon window never rendered into nitpicker",
  exits 1 — bounded and identified. run_genode_until times out at 900s
  with a clear message. Never a silent hang.

